{"id":"R0138","decision":"EXCLUDE","primary":"E6","reason":"Excluded because the full text is in Chinese (E6), with secondary failures in multi-UAV evaluation (E2) and collaborative DNN inference (E3).","e":{"E1":["T",1,"摘要","本文设计了 MASSIVE 系统,能够在多设备协同场景中,全面提升实时视频流分析的综合性能","Primary research paper proposing the MASSIVE video streaming perception system.","PDF"],"E2":["F",11,"5.1 实验环境","终端设备选用了基于mt7628芯片的开发板,运行开源的Linux OpenWrt系统","Evaluates mt7628 development boards with OPNET simulation, not a multi-UAV setting.","PDF"],"E3":["F",11,"5.1 实验环境","让多个终端设备实时向边缘服务器发送编码后的视频帧,然后边缘服务器解码图片后运行指定的DNN","Offloads full video frames to an edge server with local tracking, not distributed DNN inference across UAVs.","PDF"],"E4":["T",11,"5.1 实验环境","我们在商用设备上测试了 MASSIVE 系统","Evaluates MASSIVE on commercial hardware and OPNET Modeler 14.5 across four datasets.","PDF"],"E5":["T",1,"Metadata","网络出版日期: 2023-01-11","Online publication date 2023-01-11 is within 2021-01-01 to 2026-11-26.","PDF"],"E6":["F",1,"1 引言","近年来,随着深度学习在机器视觉领域的快速进步","Full text is written in Chinese (only abstract and captions include English).","PDF"],"E7":["U",1,"Header","中国科学:信息科学 2023年 第53卷第1期:46-65","Journal article with method and results; publisher peer-review policy not externally verified.","PDF"]}}
{"id":"R0139","decision":"EXCLUDE","primary":"E2","reason":"Excluded because it evaluates a cloud PySpark GPU cluster on static datasets rather than a multi-UAV setting (E2), and does not distribute inference across UAVs (E3).","e":{"E1":["T",1,"Abstract","This paper presents a high-performance, distributed aerial object detection architecture","Primary research paper proposing a YOLO-PySpark aerial object detection pipeline.","PDF"],"E2":["F",4,"4. Quantitative Experimental Results and Benchmark Analysis","across a distributed cloud cluster scaling from 1 to 16 NVIDIA A10G GPU nodes","Evaluates a cloud GPU cluster on static datasets, not a multi-UAV setting.","PDF"],"E3":["F",3,"3.3 PySpark Vectorized GPU Inference via Apache Arrow","Worker nodes execute batch inference using TensorRT-optimized YOLOv9 models across local GPU VRAM.","Distributes tiled inference across cloud PySpark GPU workers, not across UAVs.","PDF"],"E4":["T",3,"3.5 Performance Comparison across Aerial Detection Frameworks","Table 1 summarizes the accuracy, processing speed, and architectural capabilities","Reports mAP@0.5 and FPS benchmarks on VisDrone2023-DET and DOTA-v2.0.","PDF"],"E5":["T",1,"Header","March 2025, Volume 13, Issue 1 | www.ijedr.org","Printed issue date March 2025 is within 2021-01-01 to 2026-11-26.","PDF"],"E6":["T",1,"1. Introduction","The rapid proliferation of Unmanned Aerial Vehicles (UAVs), high-altitude drones,","Full text of the article is written in English.","PDF"],"E7":["T",0,"Peer-Reviewed Journal Policy","IJEDR is a UGC CARE–Approved Peer-Reviewed, Refereed, and Open Access Journal","Publisher site states peer-reviewed status; PDF details method and benchmark results.","https://ijedr.org/"]}}
{"id":"R0218","decision":"EXCLUDE","primary":"E1","reason":"Excluded as a literature survey/review article rather than primary research (E1), with secondary failures in E7, E2, E3, and E4.","e":{"E1":["F",2,"Abstract","This article provides a comprehensive survey of scheduling and planning algorithms","Survey/review article on UAV swarm coordination, excluded under E1.","PDF"],"E2":["F",4,"2.1 Survey Methodology","This survey methodology involves a comprehensive review and analysis of literature","Literature survey with no evaluated multi-UAV system.","PDF"],"E3":["F",4,"2.1 Survey Methodology","This survey methodology involves a comprehensive review and analysis of literature","Reviews scheduling/planning literature without proposing or evaluating collaborative DNN inference.","PDF"],"E4":["F",27,"8 Conclusion","This survey reviews scheduling and planning algorithms for large-scale UAV swarms","No experimental, simulation, or analytical evaluation of a proposed inference method.","PDF"],"E5":["T",1,"Footer","ACM Comput. Surv., Vol. 58, No. 13, Article 335. Publication date: June 2026.","Published June 2026, which is on or before 2026-11-26.","PDF"],"E6":["T",2,"1 Introduction","Recent advancements in unmanned aerial vehicle (UAV) technology and swarm intelligence","Full text of the article is written in English.","PDF"],"E7":["F",2,"Abstract","This article provides a comprehensive survey of scheduling and planning algorithms","Survey article without primary research method or evaluation results.","PDF"]}}
