{"id":"R0241","decision":"EXCLUDE","primary":"E1","reason":"Excluded as a literature survey/review article rather than primary research (E1), with secondary failures in E7, E2, E3, and E4.","e":{"E1":["F",1,"Abstract","This survey explores the promising areas of UAVs for intelligent active surveillance","Survey/review article on UAV surveillance and monitoring, excluded under E1.","PDF"],"E2":["F",6,"1 Introduction","we present a comprehensive survey aimed at enhancing the understanding","Literature survey with no evaluated multi-UAV experiment or system.","PDF"],"E3":["F",6,"1 Introduction","We provide an in-depth analysis of the key enabling technologies, architectures,","Surveys enabling technologies without proposing or evaluating collaborative DNN inference.","PDF"],"E4":["F",28,"6 Conclusion","In this survey, we studied the core concepts of UAV-based surveillance","No experimental, simulation, or analytical evaluation of a proposed method.","PDF"],"E5":["T",35,"History","Received 25 January 2024; revised 15 May 2025; accepted 19 May 2025","Accepted in May 2025 (copyright 2025), wholly within 2021-01-01 to 2026-11-26.","PDF"],"E6":["T",2,"1 Introduction","Unmanned Aerial Vehicles (UAVs) or drones are compact aerial vehicles designed","Full text of the article is written in English.","PDF"],"E7":["F",1,"Abstract","This survey explores the promising areas of UAVs for intelligent active surveillance","Survey article without primary research method or evaluation results.","PDF"]}}
{"id":"R0262","decision":"EXCLUDE","primary":"E1","reason":"Excluded as a survey/taxonomy article analyzing 104 studies rather than primary research (E1), with secondary failures in E7, E2, E3, and E4.","e":{"E1":["F",1,"Abstract","By analyzing 104 studies, we highlight nine key challenges and insights","Survey/taxonomy article on Cyber-Physical AI, excluded under E1.","PDF"],"E2":["F",3,"1 Introduction","We categorize 104 studies and provide unique insights from a CPAI perspective.","Literature survey with no evaluated multi-UAV setting.","PDF"],"E3":["F",2,"1 Introduction","we introduce a novel concept called Cyber-Physical AI (CPAI)","Conceptual taxonomy of 104 studies without collaborative DNN inference.","PDF"],"E4":["F",26,"5 Conclusion","Additionally, we reevaluate 104 studies from a CPAI perspective, highlighting key challenges","No experimental, simulation, or analytical evaluation of a proposed method.","PDF"],"E5":["T",1,"Footer","ACM Transactions on Cyber-Physical Systems, Vol. 9, No. 2, Article 19.","Publication date April 2025 (on same footer) is within 2021-01-01 to 2026-11-26.","PDF"],"E6":["T",2,"1 Introduction","The advancement of Internet of Things (IoT) technology and the development","Full text of the article is written in English.","PDF"],"E7":["F",1,"Abstract","By analyzing 104 studies, we highlight nine key challenges and insights","Survey/overview article without primary evaluation results.","PDF"]}}
